  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.4\n* Security Fix: Insufficient Validation of LogoutRequests\n* Security Fix: Missing HTML Output Encoding\n* Security Fix: Incorrect RelayState Integrity Validation\n* Security Fix: Denial of Service caused by Missing Input Validation\n\nVersion 1.0.3\n* Security Fix: Bind state and assertion to response issuer.\n* Security Fix: Bind request state to module path to prevent substitution.\n\nSee GitHub milestone issue list for details.",
  "summary": "A SAML2 Service Provider for ASP.NET. The package adds an Http module for SAML2 Authentication. It is built on top of the claims model of .NET 4.5 and uses the present infrastructure for claims translation, session authentication cookies etc.",
